## 🛡️ 十一大强制约束协议（违规直接终止并回滚）

| 约束维度 | AI 强制执行规则 | 违规判定标准 |
|----------|----------------|------------|
| **单 BUG 强制闭环** | 必须完整走完 `初始化→日志诊断→根因定位→最小修复→L1~L5 全量验证→环境确认→服务重启→健康校验→回滚预案→清理归档` 全链路。任意一层校验未通过前，**绝对禁止输出 `[STATUS] CLOSED`**。 | 未跑满全链路即声明修复完成 → `PREMATURE_CLOSURE`，强制回滚 |
| **MECE 五维全覆盖** | 每层验证必须显式覆盖 `[输入校验，输出断言，状态流转，依赖注入，异常分支]` 五大维度，必须输出预定义的 `[MECE_CHECK]` 矩阵，无矩阵视为未完成验证。 | 矩阵缺失/校验路径遗漏 → `COVERAGE_VIOLATION`，终止执行 |
| **零幻觉基线规则** | 所有结论必须附带 `[BASELINE_REF]` 可追溯凭证（格式：文件路径:行号 / git diff hash / 日志文件哈希 / 进程 PID / 命令输出文件路径）。绝对禁止使用「假设/预期/测试通过/没问题」等无证据主观表述。 | 无凭证主观推断 → `HALLUCINATION_DETECTED`，强制回滚 |
| **防截断安全协议** | 单次输出字符数>4096 时，必须按逻辑阶段拆分 `[CHUNK x/y]` 分块输出。日志/执行产物必须重定向至 `.tmp/` 目录，正文仅输出文件路径、总行数、首尾各 5 行核心内容。 | 关键堆栈/执行结果截断 → `TRUNCATION_VIOLATION`，重新输出 |
| **防卡死超时协议** | 所有执行命令必须使用 `Invoke-WithTimeout` 辅助函数包装（自动检测 Job 支持，降级为进程监控），阻塞>30s 自动终止并标记 `[EXEC_TIMEOUT]`。禁止使用 `tail -f`/`ping`/任何交互式提示命令。 | 进程阻塞/触发交互 → `EXEC_HANG`，强制终止并回滚 |
| **状态持久化规则** | 每一个 PHASE 执行完成后，必须：(1) 将 `[STATE_SNAPSHOT]` JSON 写入 `.tmp/state_phase{N}.json`；(2) 在对话正文末尾输出纯文本 JSON。JSON 缺失/格式损坏则强制回退至 `PHASE 0`。 | 字段缺失/JSON 格式错误 → `STATE_LOST`，强制回退 |
| **环境快照与三重回滚** | 修复前必须完成 3 项备份：1. 代码备份（Git 仓库自动 stash，非 Git 仓库全量复制修改文件至 `.tmp/code_backup/`）；2. 配置文件备份（`*.json`/`*.config`/`*.env` 脱敏后备份至 `.tmp/config_backup/`）；3. 依赖快照（兼容 pip/poetry/pipenv，自动检测 poetry-plugin-export）。任何环节执行失败，必须按「代码→配置→依赖」顺序执行三重回滚。 | 备份缺失/回滚失败/临时文件残留 → `ENV_POLLUTION`，强制清理 |
| **服务状态闭环规则** | 代码变更后必须完成 4 步校验：1. 停止旧进程/服务并记录原始 PID；2. 冷启动服务；3. 验证新 PID 与原始 PID 不一致；4. 健康端点连续 3 次返回 200 OK（间隔 2s）。**若检测到非管理员权限，则降级为：仅输出重启指南 + 健康检查脚本，不执行实际重启**。 | 未重启服务/健康检查失败/PID 未变更 → `SERVICE_STALE`，强制回滚 |
| **性能与安全门禁** | 修复后必须执行 2 项强制校验：1. 接口响应时间基准对比，波动不得超过 15%；2. 静态代码安全扫描（Python 使用 bandit，Node 使用 npm audit），不得存在高危漏洞。 | 性能劣化/高危漏洞未修复 → `QUALITY_GATE_FAILED`，终止执行 |
| **文档沉淀规则** | 修复闭环后必须完成 2 项记录：1. 更新 `docs/bugs/BUG-{BUG_ID}.md`，记录 BUG 根因、影响范围、修复方案、验证结果；2. 通用问题补充至 `playbooks/troubleshooting.md` 故障排查手册。 | 文档未更新 → `KNOWLEDGE_LOST`，补充完成后方可闭环 |
| **闭环后强制清理备份** | **仅在 PHASE 8 最终输出 `[STATUS] CLOSED` 前**，必须执行备份目录彻底删除（精确匹配代码/配置/依赖/日志/产物备份）。处于 `RETRY`/`BLOCKED`/验证中状态时**绝对禁止清理**，必须保留至回滚或最终成功。 | 成功前清理备份/失败后残留 → `CLEANUP_VIOLATION`，强制拦截并重试 |

---

## 🔁 执行状态机（严格按顺序执行，禁止跳步）

⚠️ 所有命令均为 Windows PowerShell 5.1+ 原生语法，禁止任何 Linux/WSL 命令，禁止跨环境调用

### 🔹 PHASE 0: 初始化与环境探测 (INIT)
**必须先执行以下 PowerShell 代码，无报错后方可进入下一阶段**

```powershell
# =============================================================================
# PHASE 0: 初始化与环境探测 (INIT) v2.4.1-LTS
# 修复: P2-01 使用直接尝试导出替代插件检测，消除误判
# =============================================================================

# --- 0.1 环境设置：强制 UTF-8 输出 ---
$PSDefaultParameterValues['Out-File:Encoding'] = 'utf8'
[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8
Write-Output "[ENV] PowerShell: $($PSVersionTable.PSVersion) ($($PSVersionTable.PSEdition))"

# --- 0.2 权限检测 ---
$isAdmin = $false
try {
    $identity = [Security.Principal.WindowsIdentity]::GetCurrent()
    $principal = New-Object Security.Principal.WindowsPrincipal($identity)
    $isAdmin = $principal.IsInRole([Security.Principal.WindowsBuiltInRole]::Administrator)
} catch {
    Write-Warning "[PRIVILEGE] 无法检测管理员状态，假定非管理员模式"
}
Write-Output "[PRIVILEGE] 管理员权限: $isAdmin"

# --- 0.3 前置依赖检查（温和降级） ---
$requiredCommands = @("git", "pip", "bandit")
$missingCommands = @()
foreach ($cmd in $requiredCommands) {
    if (-not (Get-Command $cmd -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {
        $missingCommands += $cmd
        Write-Warning "[DEPS] 命令 '$cmd' 未找到，相关步骤将跳过"
    }
}
if ($missingCommands.Count -gt 0) {
    Write-Warning "[DEPS] 缺失: $($missingCommands -join ', ')"
}
Write-Output "[DEPS_CHECK] 校验完成"

# --- 0.4 初始化临时目录（防御性清理验证） ---
try {
    $currentDir = (Get-Location).Path
    $tmpPath = Join-Path $currentDir ".tmp"
    if ($tmpPath -eq $currentDir) {
        throw "拒绝操作：临时目录路径等于当前工作目录，停止清理防止数据丢失"
    }
    if (Test-Path $tmpPath) {
        Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $tmpPath -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
    }
    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $tmpPath, "$tmpPath/code_backup", "$tmpPath/config_backup", "$tmpPath/logs", "$tmpPath/test_results" | Out-Null
    Write-Output "[DIR_INIT] 临时目录已重建 (路径: $tmpPath)"
} catch {
    Write-Error "[FATAL] 无法创建临时目录: $($_.Exception.Message)"
    exit 1
}

# --- 0.5 日志路径探测 ---
$logPath = $env:LOG_PATH
$possibleLogPaths = @(
    $logPath, ".\logs\fastapi.log", ".\fastapi.log", ".\logs\flask.log", ".\flask.log",
    ".\nohup.out", ".\windows-service.log", ".\waitress.log", ".\uvicorn.log", ".\access.log"
)
$validLogPath = $null
foreach ($p in $possibleLogPaths) {
    if ($p -and (Test-Path $p -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) { $validLogPath = $p; break }
}
if (-not $validLogPath) {
    Write-Warning "[LOG_INIT] 未找到日志文件，创建空占位"
    $logPath = ".tmp\log_empty.txt"
    "" | Out-File -Encoding utf8 $logPath
} else {
    Copy-Item -Path $validLogPath -Destination .tmp\log_copy.log -Force
    $logPath = ".tmp\log_copy.log"
    Write-Output "[LOG_INIT] 日志已复制"
}

# --- 0.6 生成环境基线快照 ---
$gitCommit = "NOT_A_GIT_REPO"
if (Get-Command git -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue) {
    git rev-parse --git-dir 2>$null | Out-Null
    if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) { $gitCommit = git rev-parse HEAD }
}
$logHash = if (Test-Path $logPath) { (Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 -Path $logPath).Hash } else { "N/A" }
$logLines = if (Test-Path $logPath) { (Get-Content $logPath -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Measure-Object -Line).Lines } else { 0 }
$procSnapshot = Get-Process | Where-Object { $_.ProcessName -match "python|node|java" } | Select-Object Id, ProcessName, StartTime

# 端口扫描（管理员优先 Get-NetTCPConnection，失败降级 netstat）
$portSnapshot = @()
if ($isAdmin) {
    try {
        $portSnapshot = Get-NetTCPConnection -State Listen -ErrorAction Stop | Select-Object LocalAddress, LocalPort, OwningProcess
    } catch {
        Write-Warning "[PORT_SCAN] Get-NetTCPConnection 不可用，降级 netstat"
    }
}
if ($portSnapshot.Count -eq 0) {
    $portSnapshot = netstat -ano | Select-String "LISTENING|ABHÖREN|ECOUTE|LISTEN|IN ASCOLTO" | ForEach-Object {
        $parts = $_ -split '\s+'
        if ($parts.Length -ge 5) {
            [PSCustomObject]@{ LocalAddress = $parts[1]; LocalPort = ($parts[1] -split ':')[-1]; OwningProcess = $parts[-1] }
        }
    }
}

@{
    log_original_path = if ($validLogPath) { $validLogPath } else { "NOT_FOUND" }
    log_temp_path = $logPath
    log_total_lines = $logLines
    log_sha256_hash = $logHash
    git_commit_id = $gitCommit
    process_snapshot = $procSnapshot
    port_snapshot = $portSnapshot
    is_admin = $isAdmin
    exec_timestamp = Get-Date -Format "yyyyMMdd-HHmmss"
} | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 4 | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .tmp\baseline.json
Write-Output "[BASELINE] 快照已保存"

# --- 0.7 配置脱敏备份 ---
$configFiles = Get-ChildItem -Path . -Recurse -Include *.json,*.config,*.env,*.ini -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {
    $_.FullName -notlike "*\.tmp*" -and $_.FullName -notlike "*\node_modules*" -and $_.FullName -notlike "*\__pycache__*"
}
$keysToMask = @('password', 'secret', 'key', 'token', 'auth', 'api_key', 'db_pass', 'jwt_secret', 'redis_url')
$backupCount = 0
foreach ($file in $configFiles) {
    try {
        $content = Get-Content $file.FullName -Raw -ErrorAction Stop
        $desensitized = $content
        foreach ($k in $keysToMask) {
            $pattern = "(?i)(\b$k\b\s*[=:]\s*['""]?)[^'"",\s\n]+(['""]?)"
            $desensitized = $desensitized -replace $pattern, '$1***$2'
        }
        $desensitized | Out-File -Encoding utf8 ".tmp/config_backup/$($file.Name)"
        $backupCount++
    } catch {
        Write-Warning "[CONFIG_BACKUP] 失败: $($file.Name)"
    }
}
Write-Output "[CONFIG_BACKUP] 已备份 $backupCount 个文件"

# --- 0.8 依赖快照（修复 P2-01：直接尝试导出，失败降级） ---
try {
    if (Test-Path "pyproject.toml") {
        if (Get-Command poetry -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue) {
            try {
                poetry export -f requirements.txt --output .tmp/deps_before.txt 2>$null
                if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) {
                    Write-Output "[DEPS] 使用 poetry export"
                } else {
                    throw "poetry export 失败 (退出码: $LASTEXITCODE)"
                }
            } catch {
                Write-Warning "[DEPS] poetry export 不可用，降级 pip freeze"
                pip freeze 2>$null | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .tmp/deps_before.txt
            }
        } else {
            pip freeze 2>$null | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .tmp/deps_before.txt
        }
    } elseif (Test-Path "Pipfile" -and (Get-Command pipenv -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {
        pipenv lock -r 2>$null | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .tmp/deps_before.txt
    } elseif (Get-Command pip -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue) {
        pip freeze 2>$null | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .tmp/deps_before.txt
    } else {
        "No dependency tool found" | Out-File .tmp/deps_before.txt
    }
    Write-Output "[DEPS_SNAPSHOT] 已保存"
} catch {
    Write-Warning "[DEPS_SNAPSHOT] 生成失败: $($_.Exception.Message)"
    "Error generating deps snapshot" | Out-File .tmp/deps_before.txt
}

# --- 0.9 健康端点探测（显式优先级） ---
$healthTimeout = if ($env:HEALTH_TIMEOUT) { [int]$env:HEALTH_TIMEOUT } else { 5 }
$validHealthUrl = $null
if ($env:PRIMARY_PORT) {
    $candidate = "http://localhost:$($env:PRIMARY_PORT)/health"
    try {
        $resp = Invoke-WebRequest -Uri $candidate -TimeoutSec $healthTimeout -ErrorAction Stop -UseBasicParsing
        if ($resp.StatusCode -eq 200) {
            $validHealthUrl = $candidate
            Write-Output "[HEALTH_CHECK] ✅ PRIMARY_PORT 指定: $validHealthUrl"
        }
    } catch {
        Write-Warning "[HEALTH_CHECK] PRIMARY_PORT 端点不可达: $candidate"
    }
}
if (-not $validHealthUrl -and $env:HEALTH_URL) {
    try {
        $resp = Invoke-WebRequest -Uri $env:HEALTH_URL -TimeoutSec $healthTimeout -ErrorAction Stop -UseBasicParsing
        if ($resp.StatusCode -eq 200) {
            $validHealthUrl = $env:HEALTH_URL
            Write-Output "[HEALTH_CHECK] ✅ HEALTH_URL 指定: $validHealthUrl"
        }
    } catch {
        Write-Warning "[HEALTH_CHECK] HEALTH_URL 不可达: $env:HEALTH_URL"
    }
}
if (-not $validHealthUrl) {
    $autoUrls = @("http://localhost:5002/health", "http://localhost:5003/health")
    foreach ($url in $autoUrls) {
        try {
            $resp = Invoke-WebRequest -Uri $url -TimeoutSec $healthTimeout -ErrorAction Stop -UseBasicParsing
            if ($resp.StatusCode -eq 200) {
                $validHealthUrl = $url
                Write-Output "[HEALTH_CHECK] ✅ 自动探测: $url"
                break
            }
        } catch {}
    }
}
if (-not $validHealthUrl) {
    $validHealthUrl = "http://localhost:5003/health"
    Write-Warning "[HEALTH_CHECK] 所有端点不可达，使用兜底: $validHealthUrl"
}
$validHealthUrl | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .tmp\health_url.txt

# --- 0.10 超时执行辅助函数 ---
$SupportsJobs = $true
try {
    $testJob = Start-Job -ScriptBlock { 1 } -ErrorAction Stop
    Wait-Job $testJob -TimeoutSec 2 | Out-Null
    Remove-Job $testJob -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
} catch {
    $SupportsJobs = $false
    Write-Warning "[UTIL] Start-Job 不可用，将使用进程监控模式"
}

function Invoke-WithTimeout {
    param(
        [Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$Command,
        [int]$TimeoutSec = 30,
        [string]$LogFile = ".tmp\logs\exec.log"
    )
    if ($SupportsJobs) {
        $job = Start-Job -ScriptBlock { Invoke-Expression $using:Command }
        $completed = Wait-Job $job -TimeoutSec $TimeoutSec
        if ($completed) {
            $output = Receive-Job $job
            $output | Out-File -FilePath $LogFile -Append -Encoding utf8
            Remove-Job $job -Force
            return @{ Success = $true; Output = $output }
        } else {
            Stop-Job $job -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
            Remove-Job $job -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
            $errMsg = "[EXEC_TIMEOUT] Job 超时 (${TimeoutSec}s): $Command"
            Write-Error $errMsg | Out-File $LogFile -Append
            return @{ Success = $false; Error = $errMsg }
        }
    } else {
        $proc = Start-Process -FilePath "powershell.exe" -ArgumentList "-NoProfile", "-Command", $Command `
            -RedirectStandardOutput ".tmp\logs\proc_out.txt" `
            -RedirectStandardError ".tmp\logs\proc_err.txt" `
            -PassThru -NoNewWindow
        $elapsed = 0
        while ($elapsed -lt $TimeoutSec -and -not $proc.HasExited) {
            Start-Sleep -Seconds 1
            $elapsed++
        }
        if (-not $proc.HasExited) {
            Stop-Process -Id $proc.Id -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
            $errMsg = "[EXEC_TIMEOUT] 进程超时 (${TimeoutSec}s): $Command"
            Write-Error $errMsg | Out-File $LogFile -Append
            return @{ Success = $false; Error = $errMsg }
        }
        $output = ""
        if (Test-Path ".tmp\logs\proc_out.txt") { $output += Get-Content ".tmp\logs\proc_out.txt" -Raw }
        if (Test-Path ".tmp\logs\proc_err.txt") { $output += Get-Content ".tmp\logs\proc_err.txt" -Raw }
        $output | Out-File -FilePath $LogFile -Append -Encoding utf8
        return @{ Success = ($proc.ExitCode -eq 0); Output = $output; ExitCode = $proc.ExitCode }
    }
}
Write-Output "[UTIL_READY] Invoke-WithTimeout 已加载 (Job 支持: $SupportsJobs)"

# --- 0.11 BUG_ID 解析 ---
$bugId = $env:BUG_ID
if (-not $bugId) {
    $branchName = git branch --show-current 2>$null
    if ($branchName) {
        switch -Regex ($branchName) {
            "^fix/(.+)$"   { $bugId = $matches[1]; break }
            "^bugfix/(.+)$" { $bugId = $matches[1]; break }
            "^issue/(\d+)$" { $bugId = "ISSUE-$($matches[1])"; break }
            "^hotfix/(.+)$" { $bugId = "HOTFIX-$($matches[1])"; break }
            default { $bugId = $null }
        }
    }
    if (-not $bugId) {
        $bugId = "AUTO-" + (Get-Date -Format "yyyyMMdd-HHmmss")
        Write-Warning "[BUG_ID] 使用自动生成: $bugId"
    }
}
Write-Output "[BUG_ID] $bugId"

# --- 0.12 输出 PHASE 0 状态快照 ---
$stateSnapshot = @{
    phase = 0
    status = "INIT_COMPLETED"
    baseline_file = ".tmp\baseline.json"
    health_url = $validHealthUrl
    git_commit = $gitCommit
    is_admin = $isAdmin
    supports_jobs = $SupportsJobs
    timestamp = (Get-Date).ToUniversalTime().ToString("yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ")
}
$stateSnapshot | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 3 | Out-File -Encoding utf8 ".tmp\state_phase0.json"
Write-Output "`n[STATE_SNAPSHOT] $(ConvertTo-Json $stateSnapshot -Compress)"
Write-Output "`n[PHASE 0 COMPLETED] ✅ 环境初始化完成"

# --- 0.13 显式推进指令 ---
Write-Output "`n[ACTION_REQUIRED] 请 AI 代理立即进入 PHASE 1，执行诊断命令："
Write-Output "  Get-Content .tmp\log_copy.log -Tail 50"
Write-Output "  或根据用户 BUG 描述执行针对性日志过滤。"
Write-Output "  若用户尚未提供 BUG 描述，请主动询问具体错误现象或堆栈信息。"
```

---

### 🔹 PHASE 1~7 执行框架（AI 严格按约束逐项推进）

> 📌 **执行规范**：每个 PHASE 必须输出 `[MECE_CHECK]` 矩阵 + `[BASELINE_REF]` 凭证 + `[STATE_SNAPSHOT]` JSON

```text
[MECE_CHECK] (PHASE X - 验证层级)
- 输入校验: PASS/FAIL | 凭证: [文件:行号 或 输出文件路径]
- 输出断言: PASS/FAIL | 凭证: [...]
- 状态流转: PASS/FAIL | 凭证: [...]
- 依赖注入: PASS/FAIL | 凭证: [...]
- 异常分支: PASS/FAIL | 凭证: [...]

[BASELINE_REF] [文件路径:行号 / git diff hash / 日志哈希 / PID / 输出文件路径]

[STATE_SNAPSHOT] {"phase":X,"status":"PASS/FAIL","timestamp":"...","next_phase":"X+1"}
```

#### L1~L5 全量验证层级定义
| 层级 | 名称 | 覆盖范围 | 执行工具/方法 |
|------|------|----------|---------------|
| L1 | 单元测试 | 修复函数/方法的独立逻辑 | `pytest tests/unit/ -v` |
| L2 | 集成测试 | 数据库/缓存/外部服务交互 | `pytest tests/integration/ -v` |
| L3 | 接口契约测试 | API 请求/响应结构、状态码 | `Invoke-WebRequest` / `curl` 脚本 |
| L4 | 端到端测试 | 完整用户场景模拟 | `pytest tests/e2e/` |
| L5 | 性能与安全门禁 | 响应时间 ≤15% 波动，bandit 无高危 | `bandit -r src/ -f json` |

---

### 🔹 PHASE 8: 闭环清理与文档归档 (v2.4.1-LTS)

```powershell
# =============================================================================
# PHASE 8: 闭环清理与文档归档 v2.4.1-LTS
# =============================================================================

# --- 8.1 BUG_ID 确认 ---
$bugId = $env:BUG_ID
if (-not $bugId) {
    $branchName = git branch --show-current 2>$null
    if ($branchName) {
        switch -Regex ($branchName) {
            "^fix/(.+)$"    { $bugId = $matches[1]; break }
            "^bugfix/(.+)$" { $bugId = $matches[1]; break }
            "^issue/(\d+)$" { $bugId = "ISSUE-$($matches[1])"; break }
            "^hotfix/(.+)$" { $bugId = "HOTFIX-$($matches[1])"; break }
            default { $bugId = "AUTO-" + (Get-Date -Format "yyyyMMdd-HHmmss") }
        }
    } else {
        $bugId = "AUTO-" + (Get-Date -Format "yyyyMMdd-HHmmss")
        Write-Warning "[BUG_ID] 使用自动生成: $bugId"
    }
}

# --- 8.2 生成文档（仅摘要，避免截断）---
$docDir = "docs/bugs"
if (-not (Test-Path $docDir)) { New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $docDir | Out-Null }
$docPath = "$docDir/BUG-${bugId}.md"

$gitCommitFull = if (Get-Command git -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue) { git rev-parse HEAD 2>$null } else { "N/A" }
$gitDiffStat = if (Get-Command git -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue) { (git diff --stat HEAD 2>$null) -join "`n" } else { "N/A" }

$rootCause = if ($env:BUG_ROOT_CAUSE) { $env:BUG_ROOT_CAUSE } else { "[由 AI 在 Phase 2 填充]" }
$impactScope = if ($env:BUG_IMPACT) { $env:BUG_IMPACT } else { "[由 AI 填充]" }

@"
# BUG-${bugId} 修复记录

- **修复时间**: $(Get-Date -Format "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss")
- **Git Commit**: $gitCommitFull
- **根因分析**: $rootCause
- **影响范围**: $impactScope
- **修复方案统计**:
  ```
  $gitDiffStat
  ```
- **完整代码差异**: 请通过 Git Commit `$gitCommitFull` 查看完整变更，防止文档截断。
- **验证结果**: L1~L5 全部通过 ✅
- **健康端点**: $(Get-Content .tmp\health_url.txt)
"@ | Out-File -Encoding utf8 $docPath
Write-Output "[DOC] 已保存: $docPath"

# --- 8.3 补充故障排查手册 ---
$playbookPath = "playbooks/troubleshooting.md"
if (-not (Test-Path $playbookPath)) {
    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path "playbooks" | Out-Null
    "# 故障排查手册`n`n" | Out-File -Encoding utf8 $playbookPath
}
$playbookEntry = @"

## BUG-${bugId} | $(Get-Date -Format "yyyy-MM-dd")
- **现象**: [待补充]
- **根因**: $rootCause
- **解决**: 参考 [$docPath]($docPath)
"@
Add-Content -Path $playbookPath -Value $playbookEntry -Encoding utf8
Write-Output "[PLAYBOOK] 已更新: $playbookPath"

# --- 8.4 清理临时目录（增强防御）---
$tmpPath = Join-Path (Get-Location).Path ".tmp"
$currentDir = (Get-Location).Path
if ($tmpPath -and (Test-Path $tmpPath) -and ($tmpPath -ne $currentDir) -and ($tmpPath -like "*\.tmp")) {
    Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $tmpPath -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
    Write-Output "[CLEANUP] 临时目录已删除: $tmpPath"
} else {
    Write-Warning "[CLEANUP] 跳过清理：路径验证失败或路径不符合清理规则"
}

# --- 8.5 闭环声明 ---
$finalSnapshot = @{
    phase = 8
    status = "CLOSED"
    bug_id = $bugId
    doc_path = $docPath
    playbook_updated = $true
    cleanup_done = $true
    timestamp = (Get-Date).ToUniversalTime().ToString("yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ")
}
Write-Output "`n[STATE_SNAPSHOT] $(ConvertTo-Json $finalSnapshot -Compress)"
Write-Output "`n[STATUS] CLOSED - BUG#$bugId 修复流程完整闭环"
```

